td-autobpmdetector
==================

This project is a fork of:

    tdautobpmsync
    https://github.com/shhhum/tdautobpmsync
    Copyright (c) shhhum

The following are the work of the upstream author and are used here substantially
unchanged:

    src/tdautobpm/model.py          - TempoNet architecture (was temponet/model.py)
    models/temponet_ckpt.pt         - trained weights, ~7,000 tracks
    src/tdautobpm/engine.py         - streaming predictor (was temponet/infer.py),
                                      modified; see the module docstring and README
                                      for a list of changes
    test_tracks/yuqt.mp3            - demo audio
    touchdesigner/autobpmsync-upstream.toe
                                    - the original TouchDesigner project file

